1. Text Generation AI\par
Text generation models produce human-like written content. They understand natural language and can generate responses, articles, summaries, stories, reports, and even conversations. These systems are trained on massive collections of text and learn patterns in language, grammar, and context.\par
Examples: ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, Gemini\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Content creation\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Email drafting\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Chatbots and virtual assistants\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Language translation\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Document summarization\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
2. Image Generation AI\par
Image generation models create new images based on text prompts or other visual inputs. Users can describe a scene in natural language, and the AI generates a corresponding image. These models are widely used in design, advertising, and digital art.\par
Examples: DALL\'b7E, Midjourney, Stable Diffusion\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Graphic design\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Marketing materials\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Product visualization\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Art and creative projects\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Image enhancement and editing\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
3. Audio and Music Generation AI\par
These systems generate speech, music, sound effects, or voice recordings. They can mimic human voices, compose original music, and convert text into natural-sounding speech.\par
Examples: ElevenLabs, Suno AI, MusicLM\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Audiobook narration\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Podcast production\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Voice assistants\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Music composition\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Accessibility tools\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
4. Video Generation AI\par
Video generation AI creates videos from text descriptions, images, or scripts. It can generate animations, realistic scenes, and even virtual presenters. This technology is rapidly evolving and is becoming increasingly important in content creation.\par
Examples: Sora, Runway, Synthesia\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Educational videos\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Marketing campaigns\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Employee training\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Social media content\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Film and animation production\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
5. Code Generation AI\par
Code generation models assist software developers by generating, reviewing, and explaining programming code. They can suggest code snippets, identify errors, and help automate repetitive development tasks.\par
Examples: GitHub Copilot, Microsoft Copilot, Amazon CodeWhisperer\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Software development\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Code debugging\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Test case generation\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Documentation creation\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Learning programming languages\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
6. Multimodal Generative AI\par
Mjkjjultimodal AI combines multiple forms of data, such as text, images, audio, and video, within a single system. These models can understand information from different sources and generate outputs across various media formats.\par
For example, a multimodal AI can analyze an image, answer questions about it, and then generate a written summary or a related image.\par
Examples: GPT-4o, Microsoft Copilot, Gemini\par
Applications:\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Intelligent digital assistants\par
